
load @term/seed/code/proof/equal
  find equal

rule congruence
  head a
  head b
  take f
    like task
      take value, like a
      like b
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  like equal b
    call f
      bind value, read x
    call f
      bind value, read y

test congruence
  take f
    like task
      take value, like a
      like b
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take proof
    like equal a x y
  fork case, read proof
    case refl
      send back
        make equal/refl
